quickstart_counts.rds

Source: six-sample Salmon example from tximportData 1.40.0.
https://bioconductor.org/packages/tximportData/
Source package license: GPL (>= 2).
TDbasedUFE license: GPL-3.

Gene-level counts were generated using tximport and
tx2gene.gencode.v27.csv. The first 10,000 of 58,288 genes
were retained, without rounding, in the original sample order.

The object contains counts, samples and source metadata.
The tximport version is recorded in source metadata.
A/B labels are illustrative labels inherited from the original
vignette, not biological group annotations.

To regenerate, run from the package root:
Rscript inst/scripts/make_quickstart_data.R

Regeneration requires tximport and the original six-sample
tximportData. Running the bundled example does not require them.
